J575d functional Apple SPMI/ACE3 DT binding backport against Linux
602042bf29f6efde39cfb5fdd9289bf4854bc0c5.

Ports only the binding deltas from the cached primary Asahi Linux head
77cb8f24c2381a8abb7272d7bbdec548d6426a8a:
  apple,spmi.yaml        3b386bcef218b0c72cbd9c5faf5e3a8cf359cd0e5b6069f413a4908336146367
  apple,sn201202x.yaml   569d97fa64a39bc520f58b5666cabe842b37a528c1dadbb0da86ca985e9c55b3

The SPMI delta adds T6030/T6031/T8122 compatible coverage, optional primary
IRQ polling, interrupt-controller/#interrupt-cells, and power-domains.  The
new ACE3 binding describes the four named child IRQs and USB-C connector.
No board DT graph, driver, recipe, or inventory change is included.

Application: patch --batch --fuzz=0 -p0 from the pinned source root.
This is functional DT binding coverage only; it does not establish hardware,
native, live, firmware, or VM operation.

